# Python bytecode from the tools/ scripts
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# H3 port artefacts. Each of these has a real near-miss behind it:
# the Dockerfile's own documented build line is `--output type=local,dest=./out`,
# which drops ~460 MB of binaries here; h3_export_comfy_dit.py writes an 11.5 GB
# .safetensors; nsys/ncu captures are tens of MB apiece.
out/
*.safetensors
*.nsys-rep
*.ncu-rep
*.sqlite
*.pid
*.webm
*.mp4
*.wav
*.diag.json
# ...but assets/ holds upstream's tracked demo clips; without this the media patterns
# above would silently skip a future `git add` of a legitimate asset.
!assets/**
